er it:\n\n- list/categories/groups from DataResourceMetadata, with category/group/tag filters\n- read/write await ReadValueHandle/WriteValueHandle (ready, future, closure)\n- resources sit behind a Mutex (write takes &mut self); the lock is never held\n  across an await\n- per-resource PayloadFormat so the binary-only uds adapters are served as hex\n  without extra code\n- diag_api errors and NRCs map to DataError; read-only writes are rejected\n\nRefs #16","tree":{"sha":"52a92353914c1cb69ef4f2d18717ab8d69171027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/inc_diagnostics/git/trees/52a92353914c1cb69ef4f2d18717ab8d69171027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/inc_diagnostics/git/commits/a9af0a815faa2e0347efd6743b81a564d0201726","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/inc_diagnostics/commits/a9af0a815faa2e0347efd6743b81a564d0201726","html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-score/inc_diagnostics/commit/a9af0a815faa2e0347efd6743b81a564d0201726","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/inc_diagnostics/commits/a9af0a815faa2e0347efd6743b81a564d0201726/comments","author":{"login":"erupuri","id":241647247,"node_id":"U_kgDODmc-jw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241647247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri","html_url":"https://github.com/erupuri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupuri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us